# Playwright

When writing Playwright scripts, always use the system-installed Google Chrome — never Chromium.

```python
# Correct
pw.chromium.launch(channel="chrome")
pw.chromium.launch_persistent_context(user_data_dir=..., channel="chrome")

# Wrong — downloads and uses Chromium
pw.chromium.launch()
pw.chromium.launch_persistent_context(user_data_dir=...)
```

Do not run `playwright install chromium` or `playwright install`. The system Chrome is already available.
